Makefile: disable testsuite and example

We do not need them in the context of Buildroot.

Also, they break for a shared-only build (but it's fixed in patch 0001).

Signed-off-by:  "Yann E. MORIN" <yann.morin.1998@free.fr>

diff --git a/Makefile.in b/Makefile.in
index 93999850..484b5761 100644
--- a/Makefile.in
+++ b/Makefile.in
@@ -20,7 +20,7 @@ OPT_NETTLE_SOURCES = @OPT_NETTLE_SOURCES@
 FAT_OVERRIDE_LIST = @FAT_OVERRIDE_LIST@
 FAT_EMULATE_LIST = @FAT_EMULATE_LIST@
 
-SUBDIRS = testsuite tools examples
+SUBDIRS = tools
 
 include config.make
